        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "When activating the effect from your trash, it's not considered to be using an Option card, so there are no color requirements and no cost to be paid.",
        "question": "What happens to the color requirements and cost when I activate this card's [Trash] effect?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "No. Activating an effect from your trash isn't considered to be using an Option card, so they don't trigger.",
